# UBSAN suppressions for the fuse-asan preset (FUSE_SANITIZE=address,undefined).
# Wired into every Source/FUSE + Tools/FUSE ctest via ENVIRONMENT by
# fuse_sanitize_finalize() in cmake/FuseSanitizers.cmake.
#
# POLICY: third-party only (Mesa/Lavapipe, LLVM, Vulkan loader, openal-soft,
# zlib, system libs). Never suppress a finding whose top FUSE frame is in
# Source/FUSE or Tools/FUSE — fix the code instead. Each entry needs a comment.
